---

This add-on is the HyperCycle Fleet Manager, originally developed as part of
the Mosaic Companion desktop application. It has been adapted to run as a
Mosaic Companion add-on.

The public HyperCycle data sources it reads are operated by HyperCycle
Development; their terms apply to the data they serve. This add-on sends no
data to them beyond the request for the figures it displays.
